### 1. Create a Driver (POST)
POST http://localhost:8085/api/drivers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Sami Ben Ali",
  "phone": "+21620111222",
  "email": "sami.benali@souktn.tn",
  "vehicleType": "MOTORCYCLE",
  "zone": "Tunis",
  "available": true
}

### 2. Get All Drivers (GET)
GET http://localhost:8085/api/drivers

### 3. Update Driver #1 (PUT)
PUT http://localhost:8085/api/drivers/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Sami Ben Ali",
  "phone": "+21620999888",
  "email": "sami.benali@souktn.tn",
  "vehicleType": "CAR",
  "zone": "Ariana",
  "available": true
}

### 4. Create a Delivery (POST)
POST http://localhost:8085/api/deliveries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": 101,
  "customerName": "Amira Trabelsi",
  "customerPhone": "+21699333444",
  "shippingAddress": "15 Avenue Habib Bourguiba",
  "city": "Tunis"
}

### 5. Get All Deliveries (GET)
GET http://localhost:8085/api/deliveries

### 6. Assign Driver #1 to Delivery #1 (PATCH)
PATCH http://localhost:8085/api/deliveries/1/assign/1

### 7. Update Delivery #1 Status to DELIVERED (PATCH)
PATCH http://localhost:8085/api/deliveries/1/status?status=DELIVERED&location=Tunis%20Centre&notes=Delivered%20to%20customer

### 8. Get Tracking History of Delivery #1 (GET)
GET http://localhost:8085/api/deliveries/1/tracking-events

### 9. Actuator Health & Info (GET)
GET http://localhost:8085/actuator/health

###
GET http://localhost:8085/actuator/info

### 10. Delete Delivery #1 (DELETE)
DELETE http://localhost:8085/api/deliveries/1

### 11. Delete Driver #1 (DELETE)
DELETE http://localhost:8085/api/drivers/1
